    "construction": "8 CCW vertices, centre (0.07,0.03) m, radius 1 m, angle 0.17+2*pi*i/8. The identical XY bytes are used at every level.",
    "outerDomain": "polygon bounding box padded by 0.25 times its maximum span on all four sides; unchanged at every refinement",
    "streamFunction": "psi=A*(Q*product_i l_i)^2, A=1 m^2/s; l_i is outward signed distance from actual polygon edge i divided by L=1 m; Q=(x-xmin)*(xmax-x)/hx^2*(y-ymin)*(ymax-y)/hy^2",
    "velocity": "u=(psi_y,-psi_x), exact divergence-free and identically zero on every original straight wall",
    "pressure": "p=1+2*x-3*y in m^2/s^2 for x,y in m; compare p-p(last cell centroid), exactly matching the native final-cell mean gauge. No fitted pressure offset in primary errors.",
    "viscosity": {
      "value": 1,
      "unit": "m^2/s"
    },
    "load": "f=grad(p)-nu*laplacian(u); analytic total-order-3 Taylor product, no numerical differentiation or alternate PDE assembly",
    "stress": "sigma=nu*(grad(u)+grad(u)^T)-p_gauged*I; wall velocity and normal strain vanish, so minus normal traction equals p_gauged",
    "symmetryCaveat": "The centrally symmetric streamfunction gives cancelling integrated viscous force. Near-exact net force here is not a force spatial-accuracy qualification; local traction/pressure and nonzero shear are the discriminating observables."
  },
